extends layout

block content
  #aboutus-container

    #aboutus-main-section
      h1 Welcome to Dental Clinician Dental Practice
      #aboutus-intro       
        div Dental care is about more than just treatments; it's about building relationships. From the moment you connect with us, we want you to feel like part of our dental family.
        img(src='/static/img/website/aboutus-intro.png', alt='About us')

      #aboutus-doctor
        h2 Meet Dr. Vijay Kumar
        #aboutus-doctor-experience
          img(src='/static/img/website/vijay-profile-photo.png', alt='photo')
          div Meet Dr. Vijay Kumar, the visionary mind behind Dental Clinician. With a BDS degree from PGIMS and experience gained from contributing to the field of healthcare AI, Dr. Vijay brings a unique blend of clinical expertise and technological innovation. His passion for advancing dental care led him to establish Dental Clinician, a seamless integration of his clinical knowledge and AI-driven solutions. Driven by a commitment to providing accessible and efficient dental solutions, he is dedicated to transforming the landscape of oral healthcare. Welcome to the future of dental care, crafted by the expertise and vision of Dr. Vijay Kumar.
        
        img#aboutus-doctor-journey(src='/static/img/website/experience-img.gif', alt='My Journey')

      #aboutus-mission
        h1 Our Mission
        div Mutualism serves as a promoter of growth. It becomes increasingly challenging to sustain growth and motivation as an isolated entity. Just as teeth and gums work together for a healthy smile, we recognize the power of unity. By seamlessly integrating advanced AI technology with comprehensive dental expertise, we aim to break down barriers to quality oral healthcare.
          p Together towards a brighter smile!
    
    
    #aboutus-bottom-section
      h1 Message to All
      #final-message "There is a supreme power that monitors and manages everything, everytime. Whatever is happening in this modern era, everything is controlled. Focus on your goals, leave all the other things, and let the controller decide your path."

